msgid "IT system map"
msgstr "IT system map"

msgid "Shows the information system layer by layer, from the network to the business processes: network equipment and cables, servers, workstations and virtual machines, installed software and applications, then the processes of the business impact analysis. Choose an item to see what its failure affects, up to the processes and their RTO, or what a process depends on, down to the network."
msgstr "Shows the information system layer by layer, from the network to the business processes: network equipment and cables, servers, workstations and virtual machines, installed software and applications, then the processes of the business impact analysis. Choose an item to see what its failure affects, up to the processes and their RTO, or what a process depends on, down to the network."

msgid "Nothing is drawn by hand: the map reads what GLPI and GRC already know (network connections, virtual machines, installed software, appliances, GLPI impact analysis, dependencies of the business processes). A missing link is completed in GLPI or on the process; two connected switches do not spread the impact, declare it in the GLPI impact analysis."
msgstr "Nothing is drawn by hand: the map reads what GLPI and GRC already know (network connections, virtual machines, installed software, appliances, GLPI impact analysis, dependencies of the business processes). A missing link is completed in GLPI or on the process; two connected switches do not spread the impact, declare it in the GLPI impact analysis."

msgid "ISO/IEC 27001, controls A.5.9 and A.5.30"
msgstr "ISO/IEC 27001, controls A.5.9 and A.5.30"

